//JS
let stack = [10, 20, 30, 40];

console.log("Oldin:", stack);

stack.reverse();

console.log("Keyin:", stack);

//FOR MY-SELF
TORI NARSANI TESKARI QILIB BERAR EKAN
Oldin: [10, 20, 30, 40]
Keyin: [40, 30, 20, 10]
==========================
Stack       → LIFO tartibida ishlaydigan ma'lumotlar
reverse()   → elementlarni teskarisiga aylantiradi
Oldin       → reverse qilishdan oldingi Stack
Keyin       → reverse qilgandan keyingi Stack
============================================
sort()      → tartiblaydi
reverse()   → teskarisiga aylantiradi
